    "message": "KAFKA-21372: Build the PartitionGroup#readyToProcess log message lazily\n\nPartitionGroup#readyToProcess formatted a not-ready message on every\ncall, and StreamTask calls it per record. StreamTask logs the message\nat most once every 120 s and discards the rest.\n\nReadyToProcessResult now holds a Supplier<String>, and\nStreamTask#maybeLogNotReady calls it only when it logs.",
